s electricity supply met by imported fossil fuels decreased from around 45% in 2013 to less than 25% in 2023, despite declining domestic coal and gas output. In the Low- RESI", "bbox": {"x": 335.6647056360527, "y": 1179.7499999358658, "width": 1104.2882352941178, "height": 204.75000000000006}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "scenario, import dependence would have approached 60% by 2023.", "bbox": {"x": 335.6647056612299, "y": 1403.9999999903055, "width": 953.4823529411766, "height": 34.12499999999988}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "In China, despite massive domestic coal production, imports made up about 10%", "bbox": {"x": 335.6647056232545, "y": 1472.2499999242696, "width": 1104.2882352941178, "height": 77.99999999999999}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "of the country's total coal supply in 2023 - and nearly 40% of its natural gas.", "bbox": {"x": 335.66470588235296, "y": 1560.0000005122909, "width": 1099.4235294117648, "height": 38.999998837709356}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Without deployment of renewables over the past decade, China's fossil fuelbased electricity generation would have been more than 25% higher. This would", "bbox": {"x": 335.41529846692885, "y": 1601.7051788186961, "width": 1104.77217465569, "height": 124.22645795345296}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "have potentially required a doubling of fossil fuel imports, raising China's electricity", "bbox": {"x": 335.4722790836388, "y": 1732.0322973282325, "width": 1104.6237156138702, "height": 87.53690564632429}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "supply import dependence from 7% to nearly 25%.", "bbox": {"x": 335.66470566421333, "y": 1828.1249999864583, "width": 705.3823529411766, "height": 34.12500000000014}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Brazil, with one of the lowest fossil fuel import dependencies among large economies - around 5% in 2023 - would also have experienced significant impacts. Without wind and solar energy deployment, fossil-based generation would have needed to rise by around 170 TWh, primarily from imported natural gas. Imports of natural gas would have increased nearly five-fold, pushing electricity import dependence to almost 30%, despite the country's large hydropower base.", "bbox": {"x": 335.3651114090307, "y": 1900.4134817625734, "width": 1104.8077305962058, "height": 299.04795455932634}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "PAGE | 81", "bbox": {"x": 778.3529409460372, "y": 2213.2499999230263, "width": 97.29411764705884, "height": 29.250000000000156}}], "ms": 265.064542}